  "description": "Abraham Lincoln was the 16th President of the United States, known for leading the country through the Civil War and issuing the Emancipation Proclamation. His assassination by John Wilkes Booth was a pivotal and tragic event in American history, symbolizing the nation's deep divisions and the cost of preserving the Union. The meme references his death as a central historical fact.",
